# RetroTok Cloud Integration
## Phase 0 — Architecture, Requirements & Implementation-Ready Technical Specification

**Project:** RetroTok  
**Module:** Cloud Video Storage, Upload Synchronization & QR Video Sharing  
**Phase:** Cloud Phase 0  
**Status:** Architecture finalized; implementation pending hosting and credential verification.

---

# 1. Project Overview

RetroTok will evolve from a fully local kiosk application into a hybrid local-and-cloud video platform.

The Android kiosk will continue to handle:
- Guest sessions
- Camera recording
- Video effects
- Soundtrack selection
- Video composition and rendering
- Local video management
- Event management

Cloud infrastructure will handle:
- Video storage
- Video upload synchronization
- Cloud-backed video feed
- QR code generation and access
- Mobile video viewing and downloading
- Automatic video expiration
- Cloud administration

The system must remain capable of recording and processing videos without an internet connection.

Internet connectivity is required only for cloud synchronization, remote playback, and QR-based video access.

**Core principle: Local-first recording, cloud-backed sharing.**

